<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Solve fairytale riddles, uncover hidden letters, and discover a glowing love story for Daisy."
    />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#10172c" />
    <title>A Classical Adventure — Once Upon a Riddle</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Playfair+Display:wght@500;600;700&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css" />
    <script>
      if (window.location.protocol === "file:") {
        document.write('<script src="assets/rapunzel-audio.js"><\/script>');
        document.write('<script src="assets/level-four-audio.js"><\/script>');
      }
    </script>
    <script src="game.js" defer></script>
  </head>
  <body>
    <section class="landing" id="landing" aria-labelledby="landing-title">
      <div class="landing-art" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="wallet-display landing-wallet" aria-label="LUVEX Bucks balance">
        <img src="assets/luvex-gem.png" alt="" />
        <span><strong id="wallet-balance-landing">0</strong> LUVEX</span>
      </div>
      <div class="landing-content">
        <p class="landing-eyebrow"><span aria-hidden="true">✦</span> Your story starts tonight <span aria-hidden="true">✦</span></p>
        <h1 class="landing-title" id="landing-title">A Classical<br />Adventure</h1>
        <button class="play-button" id="play-button" type="button">
          <span>Play</span><span class="play-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </button>
        <p class="landing-subtitle">A fairytale adventure awaits.<br />Journey safely.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="landing-footnote"><span aria-hidden="true">✧</span> Hidden letters. A little magic.</div>
    </section>

    <div id="game-screen" hidden>
      <header class="site-header">
        <button class="brand home-button" id="home-button" type="button" aria-label="Return to the adventure landing page">
          <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">✳</span>
          <span>once upon a <strong>riddle</strong></span>
        </button>
        <span class="chapter-label"><span class="chapter-dot"></span> <span id="chapter-label">Cinderella · Level 1</span></span>
        <div class="wallet-display game-wallet" aria-label="LUVEX Bucks balance">
          <img src="assets/luvex-gem.png" alt="" />
          <span><strong id="wallet-balance-game">0</strong> LUVEX</span>
        </div>
      </header>

      <main class="page-shell">
        <section class="intro" aria-labelledby="page-title">
          <p class="eyebrow"><span>✦</span> A story in little pieces <span>✦</span></p>
          <h1 id="page-title">A Cinderella story</h1>
          <p class="intro-copy">
            Follow the clues, choose the right words, and watch a little magic come together.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="game-card" id="game-card" aria-label="Cinderella riddle game">
        <div class="riddle-panel">
          <div class="panel-heading">
            <div>
              <p class="section-kicker">THE RIDDLE BOOK</p>
              <h2 id="riddle-title" tabindex="-1">A little clue for you</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="progress-count" aria-live="polite">
              <span id="progress-current">01</span>
              <span class="progress-divider">/</span>
              <span id="progress-total">04</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="progress-track" aria-label="Riddle progress">
            <div class="progress-fill" id="progress-fill"></div>
          </div>

          <div class="riddle-content" aria-live="polite">
            <span class="clue-star" aria-hidden="true">✧</span>
            <p class="riddle-text" id="riddle-text"></p>
            <p class="answer-prompt">Pick the word that solves it</p>
            <div class="answer-options" id="answer-options"></div>
          </div>

          <p class="game-message" id="game-message" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
          <div class="panel-footer">
            <span class="tiny-sparkle" aria-hidden="true">✦</span>
            <span>Every answer reveals a piece of the tale</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="puzzle-panel">
          <div class="puzzle-heading">
            <div>
              <p class="section-kicker">THE PUZZLE BOARD</p>
              <h2 id="puzzle-title">A night to remember</h2>
            </div>
            <span class="piece-counter" id="piece-counter" aria-live="polite">0 of 4 pieces</span>
          </div>

          <div class="puzzle-board" id="puzzle-board" aria-label="A four-piece Cinderella picture puzzle">
            <svg class="puzzle-art" viewBox="0 0 736 855" role="img" aria-labelledby="art-title art-description">
              <title id="art-title">Cinderella and the prince at the palace</title>
              <desc id="art-description">
                Cinderella and the prince share a glass slipper in front of a glowing palace. The picture is revealed as four interlocking puzzle pieces.
              </desc>
              <defs>
                <clipPath id="piece-a">
                  <path d="M0 0H368V182C368 198 418 196 418 230C418 264 368 262 368 278V460H230C214 460 216 510 184 510C152 510 154 460 138 460H0Z" />
                </clipPath>
                <clipPath id="piece-b">
                  <path d="M368 0H736V460H598C582 460 584 510 552 510C520 510 522 460 506 460H368V278C368 262 418 264 418 230C418 196 368 198 368 182V0Z" />
                </clipPath>
                <clipPath id="piece-c">
                  <path d="M0 460H138C154 460 152 410 184 410C216 410 214 460 230 460H368V855H0Z" />
                </clipPath>
                <clipPath id="piece-d">
                  <path d="M368 460H506C522 460 520 410 552 410C584 410 582 460 598 460H736V855H368Z" />
                </clipPath>
              </defs>
              <g class="puzzle-piece" data-piece="0"><image href="assets/cinderella-puzzle.jpg" width="736" height="855" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" clip-path="url(#piece-a)" /></g>
              <g class="puzzle-piece" data-piece="1"><image href="assets/cinderella-puzzle.jpg" width="736" height="855" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" clip-path="url(#piece-b)" /></g>
              <g class="puzzle-piece" data-piece="2"><image href="assets/cinderella-puzzle.jpg" width="736" height="855" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" clip-path="url(#piece-c)" /></g>
              <g class="puzzle-piece" data-piece="3"><image href="assets/cinderella-puzzle.jpg" width="736" height="855" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" clip-path="url(#piece-d)" /></g>
              <g class="empty-board">
                <rect x="1" y="1" width="734" height="853" rx="12" />
                <path d="M368 0V182C368 198 418 196 418 230C418 264 368 262 368 278V855" />
                <path d="M0 460H138C154 460 152 510 184 510C216 510 214 460 230 460H506C522 460 520 410 552 410C584 410 582 460 598 460H736" />
              </g>
            </svg>
            <div class="board-hint" id="board-hint">
              <span class="hint-sparkle" aria-hidden="true">✧</span>
              <span>Your fairytale is waiting<br />to be pieced together</span>
            </div>
            <div class="complete-stamp" id="complete-stamp" aria-hidden="true">THE END <span>♥</span></div>
          </div>

          <p class="puzzle-caption" id="puzzle-caption">Solve a riddle to reveal the first piece</p>
        </div>
        </section>

        <footer class="page-footer">
          <span>Made of moonlight &amp; a little word magic</span>
          <span aria-hidden="true">♡</span>
        </footer>
      </main>
    </div>
    <section class="meadow-level" id="meadow-level" aria-label="Daisy letter discovery" hidden>
      <header class="meadow-header">
        <button class="brand home-button" id="meadow-home-button" type="button" aria-label="Return to the adventure landing page">
          <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">✳</span>
          <span>once upon a <strong>riddle</strong></span>
        </button>
        <span class="chapter-label">Daisy · Level 3</span>
        <div class="wallet-display game-wallet" aria-label="LUVEX Bucks balance">
          <img src="assets/luvex-gem.png" alt="" />
          <span><strong id="wallet-balance-meadow">0</strong> LUVEX</span>
        </div>
      </header>
      <p class="meadow-instruction" id="meadow-instruction">A bright light is hiding something in the meadow. Tap to uncover it.</p>
      <button class="meadow-uncover" id="meadow-uncover" type="button">
        <span class="white-glow" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span>Tap to uncover</span>
      </button>
      <button class="meadow-rock" id="meadow-rock" type="button" aria-label="Tap the glowing stone to reveal the hidden letters" hidden>
        <img src="assets/daisy-stone.png" alt="" />
        <span class="rock-glow" aria-hidden="true">Tap the stone</span>
      </button>
      <div class="meadow-letters" id="meadow-letters" aria-live="polite" hidden>SY</div>
      <section class="meadow-answer-card" id="meadow-answer-card" aria-labelledby="meadow-answer-title" hidden>
        <div class="scroll-stage meadow-scroll">
          <img class="scroll-art" src="assets/farewell-scroll.png" alt="" />
          <div class="meadow-scroll-copy">
            <h1 id="meadow-answer-title">Put all the letters together</h1>
            <p class="meadow-letter-clue">You have found <strong>D</strong>, <strong>AI</strong>, and <strong>SY</strong>.</p>
            <form class="meadow-answer-form" id="meadow-answer-form">
              <label for="meadow-answer">Write the full word</label>
              <div class="meadow-answer-controls">
                <input id="meadow-answer" name="answer" type="text" maxlength="30" autocomplete="off" required />
                <button type="submit">Check</button>
              </div>
              <p class="meadow-message" id="meadow-message" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
            </form>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </section>
    <section class="love-level" id="love-level" aria-label="A love story for Daisy" hidden>
      <h1 class="love-title" id="love-title" tabindex="-1">
        <span class="love-phrase">
          <span class="love-word">loving</span>
          <span class="love-word">you</span>
          <span class="love-word">is</span>
          <span class="love-word">worth</span>
          <span class="love-word">it</span>
          <span class="love-word">all</span>
        </span>
        <strong class="love-name">
          <span class="love-word">DAISY</span>
          <span class="love-word">Niingo</span>
        </strong>
      </h1>
      <canvas class="love-heart" id="love-heart" width="700" height="560" role="img" aria-label="A glowing red heart being drawn in the darkness"></canvas>
      <button class="love-next" id="love-next" type="button" aria-label="Continue to the next level" hidden>
        <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      </button>
    </section>
    <main class="finale-level" id="finale-level" aria-labelledby="finale-title" hidden>
      <header class="finale-heading">
        <p class="finale-eyebrow">✧ A little universe of memories ✧</p>
        <h1 id="finale-title" tabindex="-1">Every picture holds a piece of you</h1>
        <p class="finale-intro">A few moments I never want to forget.</p>
      </header>
      <section class="memory-gallery" id="memory-gallery" aria-label="Interactive photo carousel">
        <div class="memory-carousel" id="memory-carousel">
          <div class="memory-stage" id="memory-stage" role="region" tabindex="0" aria-label="Photograph carousel. Use the arrow keys or swipe to browse." aria-live="polite">
            <button class="memory-photo" type="button" data-photo="0" aria-label="Open the first photograph">
              <img src="assets/stuck-on-you-photo-one.jpeg" alt="A mirror selfie in a classroom" draggable="false" />
            </button>
            <button class="memory-photo" type="button" data-photo="1" aria-label="Open the second photograph">
              <img src="assets/stuck-on-you-photo-two.png" alt="A sunlit close-up mirror selfie" draggable="false" />
            </button>
            <button class="memory-photo" type="button" data-photo="2" aria-label="Open the third photograph">
              <img src="assets/stuck-on-you-photo-three.jpeg" alt="A figure looking toward a sunset" draggable="false" />
            </button>
          </div>
          <button class="carousel-control carousel-previous" id="memory-previous" type="button" aria-label="Show previous photograph">←</button>
          <button class="carousel-control carousel-next" id="memory-next" type="button" aria-label="Show next photograph">→</button>
          <p class="memory-hint">Swipe, tap the arrows, or choose a photograph to bring it closer.</p>
          <div class="memory-indicators" id="memory-indicators" aria-label="Choose a photograph"></div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <a class="poem-invitation" href="#poem-scroll" id="poem-invitation">
        <span>There are words my heart has been holding</span>
        <strong aria-hidden="true">↓</strong>
      </a>
      <section class="poem-chapter" id="poem-scroll" aria-labelledby="poem-title">
        <header class="poem-chapter-heading">
          <p class="finale-eyebrow">✧ Written from the heart ✧</p>
          <h2 id="poem-title">Stuck on You</h2>
          <p>Take your time. These words are for you.</p>
        </header>
        <article class="finale-poem" aria-label="Stuck on You, by J.N">
          <p>They said,<br />“In this lifetime,<br />If you ever experience<br />The love of a poet,<br />You are lucky.”</p>
          <p>A guess in a million,<br />The universe chose you.</p>
          <p>I guess my heart played<br />A different Rythm.<br />I hate admit,<br />But it’s the Rythm of<br />You.</p>
          <p>I hate admit how every time<br />I tell myself, move forward,<br />My mind swirls back to the<br />Thought 💭 of you.</p>
          <p>Oh, how interesting it is to desire<br />And to hold.</p>
          <p>Even so, it’s that type of<br />Of love again,<br />The forbidden,<br />Because you belong to<br />This heart.</p>
          <p>When you are around,<br />My world accelerates.</p>
          <p>And when you are gone,<br />My world decelerates.</p>
          <p>Oh, beautiful flower,<br />I got stuck on the gaze of you.</p>
          <p>And when and if the universe grants me you,<br />I will hold you close and true.</p>
          <p class="finale-signature">J.N<br /><br />By 🦋~</p>
        </article>
      </section>
      <footer class="finale-goodbye">
        <p>The adventure ends here. Thank you. Sending lots of love your way and a gentle embrace.</p>
        <button class="back-start-button" id="finale-back-button" type="button">Back to start</button>
      </footer>
    </main>
    <dialog class="photo-dialog" id="photo-dialog" aria-label="Photograph viewer">
      <button class="photo-dialog-close" id="photo-dialog-close" type="button" aria-label="Close photograph">×</button>
      <img id="photo-dialog-image" alt="" />
      <p id="photo-dialog-caption"></p>
    </dialog>
    <section class="end-screen" id="end-screen" aria-labelledby="end-title" hidden>
      <div class="end-screen-header">
        <span class="end-chapter"><span aria-hidden="true">✦</span> <span id="end-chapter-label">A Cinderella story · Chapter complete</span></span>
        <div class="wallet-display end-wallet" aria-label="LUVEX Bucks balance">
          <img src="assets/luvex-gem.png" alt="" />
          <span><strong id="wallet-balance-end">0</strong> LUVEX</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <main class="end-content">
        <p class="end-eyebrow">✧ A little message for the road ✧</p>
        <div class="scroll-stage">
          <img class="scroll-art" src="assets/farewell-scroll.png" alt="" />
          <div class="scroll-copy">
            <h1 id="end-title" tabindex="-1">The day has danced away, but leaves you with another clue. Collect the letters, for at the end they unite.</h1>
            <p class="day-letter"><span id="day-letter-label">The letter of the day is</span> <strong id="day-letter">D</strong></p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="end-prompt" id="end-prompt" aria-live="polite"></p>
        <button class="back-start-button" id="back-start-button" type="button">
          <span aria-hidden="true">→</span> Next level
        </button>
      </main>
    </section>
    <p class="wallet-message visually-hidden" id="wallet-message" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    <button class="music-toggle" id="music-toggle" type="button" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Turn music on">
      <span class="music-icon" aria-hidden="true">♫</span>
      <span id="music-label">Music: off</span>
    </button>
    <p class="visually-hidden" id="music-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
  </body>
</html>
